### Batch UPER hex to XER, one message per line.  The invalid second line produces an empty output line.
POST http://localhost:4000/batch/uper/xer/MessageFrame
Content-Type: text/plain


00


### Batch UPER hex to JER from a file
POST http://localhost:4000/batch/uper/jer/MessageFrame
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./messages_uper.txt

### Batch JER to UPER hex from a file
POST http://localhost:4000/batch/jer/uper/MessageFrame
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./messages_jer.txt

